<title>USA: Giddings &amp; Lewis names Isles as CEO.</title>
<headline>Giddings &amp; Lewis names Isles as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FOND DU LAC, Wis. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giddings &amp; Lewis Inc said Monday it elected president and chief operating officer Marvin Isles to the position of president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Isles takes over as CEO effective immediately for Joseph Coppola, who will remain chairman until his retirement sometime later this year.  </p>
<p>Isles joined the company in June 1996 after a 17-year career with GenCorp, where he had served as executive vice president.</p>
<p>Giddings &amp; Lewis supplies industrial automation products and machine tools.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
